## DEV

### environment update

robomimic 0.2.0 does not have dexmimicgen and libero. 
Following https://github.com/JINXER000/dexmimicgen, 
I upgraded it to 0.3.1. 
```
git clone https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robomimic.git -b dexmimicgen
cd robomimic
pip install -e .
```
Robosuite is updated to 1.5.1. But robomimic still fails to import robosuite. 
After debugging, I found the problem: there is a numba.py under robosuite.utils, which import numba again,
making python confused as a circular import. I renamed it to numba_utils.py, so please download the customized version: https://github.com/JINXER000/robosuite_costomized.git.
If you have installed robosuite before, make sure to delete it completely.
Check using
```
ls -la /home/user/miniforge3/envs/robodiff2/lib/python3.9/site-packages | grep robosuite
```
Delete if there is left over files.

